{"4443490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BrushCutter", "steam_appid": 4443490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brushcutter</strong> is a tree-cutting game featuring  real-life-based physics. Bring everything you need to fulfill your mission of restoring the forest to its full potential through silviculture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Silviculture</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't about cutting everything in your path; it’s about allowing high-quality trees to grow big and strong by removing the surrounding growth that is suffocating them. Find the best trees, prioritize their growth, and earn more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443490/extras/27724d06bdff7ce90cf8669b9f5b23bb.poster.avif?t=1771705137\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443490/extras/27724d06bdff7ce90cf8669b9f5b23bb.mp4?t=1771705137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BrushCutter Physics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutting requires precision, not just force. There are obstacles that make the job harder, requiring you to fell trees strategically so they don't block your way. Trees react dynamically to your motions and blade angles. Attack every cut with a strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443490/extras/10e3a879c7148fb5dce392dedbdf9d78.poster.avif?t=1771705137\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443490/extras/10e3a879c7148fb5dce392dedbdf9d78.webm?t=1771705137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443490/extras/10e3a879c7148fb5dce392dedbdf9d78.mp4?t=1771705137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your saw and your equipment. Start in clear forests with basic tools and work your way into the densest forests with the best gear. Use a wide range of upgrades to help you succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Music</strong><br><br>&quot;Gonna Start&quot; Kevin MacLeod (from incompetech)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 License</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brushcutter</strong> is a tree-cutting game featuring  real-life-based physics. Bring everything you need to fulfill your mission of restoring the forest to its full potential through silviculture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Silviculture</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't about cutting everything in your path; it’s about allowing high-quality trees to grow big and strong by removing the surrounding growth that is suffocating them. Find the best trees, prioritize their growth, and earn more money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443490/extras/27724d06bdff7ce90cf8669b9f5b23bb.poster.avif?t=1771705137\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443490/extras/27724d06bdff7ce90cf8669b9f5b23bb.mp4?t=1771705137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BrushCutter Physics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cutting requires precision, not just force. There are obstacles that make the job harder, requiring you to fell trees strategically so they don't block your way. Trees react dynamically to your motions and blade angles. Attack every cut with a strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443490/extras/10e3a879c7148fb5dce392dedbdf9d78.poster.avif?t=1771705137\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443490/extras/10e3a879c7148fb5dce392dedbdf9d78.webm?t=1771705137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443490/extras/10e3a879c7148fb5dce392dedbdf9d78.mp4?t=1771705137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your saw and your equipment. Start in clear forests with basic tools and work your way into the densest forests with the best gear. Use a wide range of upgrades to help you succeed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><strong>Music</strong><br><br>&quot;Gonna Start&quot; Kevin MacLeod (from incompetech)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 License</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Slice t